flowchart TD
    A[User opens http://localhost:5173] --> B[React app loads, GET /api/health]
    B --> C{Ollama reachable?}
    C -->|yes| D[Header shows: Ollama connected]
    C -->|no| E[Header shows: Ollama unavailable]
    D --> F[User uploads PDF or image]
    E --> F
    F --> G[POST /api/documents/upload]
    G --> H[file_service.save_upload validates type/size/empty]
    H -->|invalid| I[400/413 error shown as toast]
    H -->|valid| J[File saved to app/data/uploads, registry record created]
    J --> K[BackgroundTasks: file_service.process_document]
    K --> L[pdf_service.extract_document - PyMuPDF text per page]
    L --> M{Page has < 20 chars text?}
    M -->|yes| N[Render page at 200 dpi and run Tesseract OCR]
    M -->|no| O[Keep native text]
    N --> P[table_service.extract_tables - pdfplumber]
    O --> P
    P --> Q[chunk_service.chunk_pages - sections with doc name + page number]
    Q --> R[embedding_service.embed_texts via Ollama /api/embed nomic-embed-text]
    R --> S[vector_store.add_sections - FAISS IndexFlatIP + JSON metadata]
    S --> T[Document status: ready / partially_processed / failed]
    T --> U[Frontend polls GET /api/documents every 2.5s until done]
    U --> V[User asks a question]
    V --> W[POST /api/chat]
    W --> X[retrieval_service.retrieve - embed question, FAISS cosine search, min score 0.35, top-k 8]
    X -->|no section above threshold| Y[Return exact refusal sentence, evidence_status=not_found, no model call]
    X -->|sections found| Z[retrieval_service.build_context - numbered evidence blocks within 12000 chars]
    Z --> AA[answer_service: ANSWER_PROMPT + evidence + question to Ollama /api/generate qwen2.5:1.5b, temperature 0]
    AA --> AB[_parse_response extracts Answer and Evidence status]
    AB --> AC[verification_service.verify - numbers in answer must exist in evidence]
    AC --> AD[citation_service.build_sources - sources built ONLY from retrieved sections]
    AD --> AE[ChatResponse: answer + evidence_status + sources + verification]
    AE --> AF[Frontend ChatMessage renders answer, badge, warnings, SourceCards]
    AF --> AG[Optional: POST /api/reports -> ReportLab PDF -> download]
